      "content": "that makes sense. what about the 'personality' of the wear? like, for the stone, does it tend to look more weathered and organic as it ages, or does it just look broken/damaged? and with the concrete, is there a way to make the surface look more 'distressed' on purpose so it doesn't look like it's just failing?",
